PowerCard Hardware License
===========================

SPDX-License-Identifier: CERN-OHL-S-2.0

The hardware design files in this repository — Gerbers, drill files, and (once
published) schematics, PCB layout source, and mechanical/3D files — are
licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 – Strongly Reciprocal
(CERN-OHL-S-2.0).

This file intentionally does NOT paste a re-typed copy of the license's legal
text, to avoid the risk of an inaccurate or incomplete reproduction of a legal
document. Before your first public release, please replace this file with the
verbatim, official license text, which CERN publishes at:

    https://cern-ohl.web.cern.ch/
    https://spdx.org/licenses/CERN-OHL-S-2.0.html

In short (this summary is not a substitute for the actual license text):
CERN-OHL-S is a "strongly reciprocal" (copyleft) hardware license. If you
convey a product built from this design, or a modified version of this
design, you must make the corresponding complete source (design files)
available under the same license, and preserve notices. See the official
text linked above for the actual, binding terms.

Copyright (c) 2026 the PowerCard project contributors.